---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Lost update: two clients run read-modify-write on the same counter (left),
// versus pushing the increment into the database as one atomic UPDATE (right).
// Plain inline SVG, site tokens only, polygon arrowheads (no duplicate ids).
const W = 900;
const H = 440;
---
<figure class="txlu">
  <div class="txlu-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two panels comparing a counter at value 42. Left, read-modify-write: client A and client B both read 42, both compute 43, both write 43, so the final value is 43 and one increment is lost. Right, atomic update: the database applies value = value + 1 twice in turn, so the final value is 44.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="txlu-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Same two clicks, two different outcomes</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cùng hai lần bấm, hai kết cục khác nhau</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Left panel */}
    <rect x="20" y="48" width="430" height="360" rx="6" class="txlu-panel is-bad" />
    <text x="36" y="76" class="txlu-sec is-bad">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Read-modify-write in app code</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Đọc-sửa-ghi trong code ứng dụng</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="96" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Client A</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client A</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="226" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Database row</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dòng trong DB</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="376" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Client B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client B</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={56} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="96" y1="118" x2="96" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={154} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="226" y1="118" x2="226" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={336} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="376" y1="118" x2="376" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />

    {/* step 1: A reads */}
    <path d="M100,142 L214,142" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="222,142 214,138 214,146" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="158" y="135" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. read</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. đọc</tspan>
    </text>
    {/* step 2: B reads */}
    <path d="M372,182 L238,182" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="230,182 238,178 238,186" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="304" y="175" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. read</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. đọc</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="186" y="198" width="80" height="26" rx="4" class="txlu-box" />
    <text x="226" y="216" class="txlu-val" text-anchor="middle">42</text>
    <text x="96" y="232" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>holds 42, computes 43</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>giữ 42, tính ra 43</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="366" y="232" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>holds 42, computes 43</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>giữ 42, tính ra 43</tspan>
    </text>
    {/* step 3: A writes */}
    <path d="M100,276 L214,276" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="222,276 214,272 214,280" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="158" y="269" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>3. write 43</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>3. ghi 43</tspan>
    </text>
    {/* step 4: B writes */}
    <path d="M372,316 L238,316" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="230,316 238,312 238,320" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="304" y="309" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>4. write 43</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>4. ghi 43</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="166" y="340" width="120" height="30" rx="4" class="txlu-box is-bad" />
    <text x="226" y="360" class="txlu-val is-bad" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>43: one lost</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>43: mất một</tspan>
    </text>

    {/* Right panel */}
    <rect x="470" y="48" width="410" height="360" rx="6" class="txlu-panel" />
    <text x="486" y="76" class="txlu-sec">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One atomic UPDATE in the database</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một UPDATE nguyên tử trong DB</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="540" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Client A</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client A</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="670" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Database row</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Dòng trong DB</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="820" y="108" class="txlu-lane" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Client B</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Client B</tspan>
    </text>
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={500} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="540" y1="118" x2="540" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={598} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="670" y1="118" x2="670" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={780} y={103} size={20} />
    <line x1="820" y1="118" x2="820" y2="392" class="txlu-life" />

    <path d="M544,142 L658,142" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="666,142 658,138 658,146" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="602" y="135" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>1. value + 1</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>1. value + 1</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="630" y="158" width="80" height="26" rx="4" class="txlu-box" />
    <text x="670" y="176" class="txlu-val" text-anchor="middle">43</text>

    <path d="M816,222 L682,222" class="txlu-arrow" /><polygon points="674,222 682,218 682,226" class="txlu-head" />
    <text x="748" y="215" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>2. waits, then value + 1</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>2. chờ, rồi value + 1</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="630" y="238" width="80" height="26" rx="4" class="txlu-box" />
    <text x="670" y="256" class="txlu-val" text-anchor="middle">44</text>

    <text x="670" y="302" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The row lock is held while the</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Khoá dòng được giữ trong lúc</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="670" y="320" class="txlu-note" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>statement runs; no stale read</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>câu lệnh chạy; không có lần đọc cũ</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="595" y="340" width="150" height="30" rx="4" class="txlu-box is-ok" />
    <text x="670" y="360" class="txlu-val" text-anchor="middle">
      <tspan data-lang-en>44: both kept</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>44: giữ đủ cả hai</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Two clients increment a counter that holds 42. When each one reads first and writes later, both compute 43 from the same stale read and the second write erases the first. Moving the arithmetic into the database (<code>SET value = value + 1</code>) removes the stale read, so the result is 44.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Hai client cùng tăng một bộ đếm đang ở 42. Khi mỗi bên đọc trước rồi ghi sau, cả hai cùng tính ra 43 từ một lần đọc đã cũ và lần ghi sau xoá mất lần ghi trước. Đẩy phép tính xuống database (<code>SET value = value + 1</code>) thì không còn lần đọc cũ nào, kết quả là 44.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txlu { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txlu-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txlu svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txlu text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txlu .txlu-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlu .txlu-sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlu .txlu-sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txlu .txlu-lane { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlu .txlu-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txlu .txlu-val { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txlu .txlu-val.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txlu-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txlu-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txlu-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txlu-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txlu-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txlu-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txlu-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txlu-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txlu figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
